  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Deep underground in Forest Lightning grotto-heaven, a vast lightning forest flashes and thunders without pause. The flashes of lightning form a tall silver tree that lasts only a moment, with large thunder leaves and many silver lightning branches that materialize and tempt the watching immortals. The two heavens alliance’s Gu Immortals call these priceless lightning path rank eight immortal materials.",
