      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Those surface forms are only the superficial wealth of the lightning forest. Records in The Legends of Ren Zu say the source of a lightning forest is lightning Gu, and the scale of this forest is enough to prove a rank eight lightning Gu is present.",
